 "segments": [
  {
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 3.72,
   "text": "Cloud Code can now control your iPhone for you, opening apps and tapping through screens"
  },
  {
   "start": 3.72,
   "end": 4.8,
   "text": "just like a real person."
  },
  {
   "start": 4.92,
   "end": 8.9,
   "text": "This is Mirar MCP, and it works through Apple's iPhone mirroring on your Mac, so Cloud can"
  },
  {
   "start": 8.9,
   "end": 11.4,
   "text": "read your phone screen and tap, swipe, and type for you."
  },
  {
   "start": 11.48,
   "end": 14.68,
   "text": "To install it, you just run this one command and connect it to Cloud Code or Codex."
  },
  {
   "start": 14.8,
   "end": 17.94,
   "text": "Then you can use it to automate whole workflows, test your own apps or on a real device,"
  },
  {
   "start": 18.18,
   "end": 20.9,
   "text": "or just hand off all the boring stuff that you have to do on your phone every"
  },
  {
   "start": 20.9,
   "end": 21.18,
   "text": "day."
  },
  {
   "start": 21.32,
   "end": 24.58,
   "text": "Plus you can block it from apps like Wallet or your banking apps, you always stay"
  },
  {
   "start": 24.58,
   "end": 24.98,
   "text": "in control."
  },
  {
   "start": 25.22,
   "end": 27.76,
   "text": "If you want the whole setup guide, just comment phone down below and I'll"
  },
  {
   "start": 27.76,
   "end": 28.58,
   "text": "send you the links directly."
  }
 ]
}